Fixed: parallel::fullydistributed::Triangulation, when created from a
serial triangulation with refined tetrahedra, wedges or pyramids, now
contains all cells behind refined triangular faces of locally owned cells
as ghost cells. Before, the cell behind the middle child of such a face
could be missing, and MatrixFree computed wrong face integrals on these
faces.
<br>
(Lukas Dreyer, 2026/11/27)
